1
00:00:03,878 --> 00:00:07,838
(Howard:)All right, Raj has played
his Phantom Warlord card...

2
00:00:08,008 --> 00:00:12,848
(Howard:)...and I am going to back him up
with my Strangling Vines.

3
00:00:13,847 --> 00:00:16,057
Choke on that, sucker.

4
00:00:16,599 --> 00:00:21,349
(Leonard:)Okay. Well, then I'll just cut your vines
with my Ruby Sword.

5
00:00:21,521 --> 00:00:25,231
That's right, I did it. I cut them.

6
00:00:25,525 --> 00:00:27,275
(Penny:)Um....

7
00:00:28,445 --> 00:00:30,115
(Penny:)I have a question.

8
00:00:31,072 --> 00:00:34,532
(Leonard:)Warlord beats troll, troll beats elf,
elf beats water sprite...

9
00:00:34,701 --> 00:00:38,661
(Leonard:)...and basically everything beats
Enchanted Bunny.

10
00:00:38,872 --> 00:00:40,752
Unless you have the Carrot of Power.

11
00:00:41,666 --> 00:00:43,876
(Penny:)Okay, I've got another question.

12
00:00:44,044 --> 00:00:45,924
(Penny:)When does this get fun?

13
00:00:46,838 --> 00:00:50,838
Are we gonna talk or are we gonna play
Mystic Warlords of Ka-ah?

14
00:00:51,009 --> 00:00:53,139
(Leonard:)Just play a potion card.

15
00:00:53,303 --> 00:00:54,553
(Penny:)Which one?

16
00:00:54,721 --> 00:00:57,761
(Sheldon:)It doesn't matter,
you can't possibly win.

17
00:00:57,974 --> 00:01:00,354
(Leonard:)-Don't ruin the game.
-How could he ruin the game?

18
00:01:00,518 --> 00:01:04,358
Given the cards already played, Penny can
only be holding Necromancer Potions...

